  },
  data: {
    LLM: '1. **Multiple Lead**: You can lead one card, two of a suit, or three of a suit.\n2. **Response**: Subsequent players MUST play the same number of cards.\n3. **Trumping**: Any card in a lead can be beaten by a higher card of the same suit or a Trump card.\n4. **Capturing**: To win the trick, a player must beat ALL cards led with individual higher cards.\n5. **Drawing**: After a trick, everyone draws from stock back to 4 cards.',
    Player: '1. **Multiple Lead**: You can lead one card, two of a suit, or three of a suit.\n2. **Response**: Subsequent players MUST play the same number of cards.\n3. **Trumping**: Any card in a lead can be beaten by a higher card of the same suit or a Trump card.\n4. **Capturing**: To win the trick, a player must beat ALL cards led with individual higher cards.\n5. **Drawing**: After a trick, everyone draws from stock back to 4 cards.',
    objective: "Capture at least 31 points (in a single round) or 61 points (if scores are combined) to win. Avoid getting zero points ('The Goat').",
    gameplay: '1. **Multiple Lead**: You can lead one card, two of a suit, or three of a suit.\n2. **Response**: Subsequent players MUST play the same number of cards.\n3. **Trumping**: Any card in a lead can be beaten by a higher card of the same suit or a Trump card.\n4. **Capturing**: To win the trick, a player must beat ALL cards led with individual higher cards.\n5. **Drawing**: After a trick, everyone draws from stock back to 4 cards.',
    keyRules: [
      'Lead one to four cards of the same suit.',
      'Followers must play the same number of cards.',
      'No obligation to follow suit; beat with higher card of same suit or any trump.',
      'To win a trick, beat every led card with a higher card.',
      'After each trick, players draw from stock to refill to four cards.',
      'Declarations (Bura, Moskva, Molodka) may seize the lead.',
    ],
