    turnFlow: '1. **Multiple Lead**: You can lead one card, two of a suit, or three of a suit.\n2. **Response**: Subsequent players MUST play the same number of cards.\n3. **Trumping**: Any card in a lead can be beaten by a higher card of the same suit or a Trump card.\n4. **Capturing**: To win the trick, a player must beat ALL cards led with individual higher cards.\n5. **Drawing**: After a trick, everyone draws from stock back to 4 cards.',
